Since the Milestone 4 Update, our team has been aggregating player feedback for some time and we've been working on making the game more forgiving, and empowering players with more freedom to experiment.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34433714/1d4420b9347b4d876663d091b792fae09497d316.gif[/img]

[b]Major Balance Changes: [/b]
[list]
[*] Now you can sleep until fully healed in beds in your base and shelters in the Radius. Beware it takes 12 hours, so your cores can expire, and you are getting hungry at a normal rate;
[*] Doubled the distance player can sprint on full stamina;
[*] Upon death, now only items in your backpack are dropped instead of all items;
[*] New Area to explore - the Construction site;
[*] Road Signs placed on roads to help with navigation.
[/list]

[b]Minor Balance Changes:[/b]
[list]
[*] Changed wording of Secondary Missions to Optional for better understanding of their function;
[*] Shotguns jam from a deteriorated condition like other guns;
[*] Flashlights illuminate worse depending on condition;
[*] Detectors introduce noise in their readings depending on condition;
[*] Reduced Healing Booth prices;
[*] Reduced fog weather duration and chances to occur.
[/list]

[b]Bug Fixes:[/b]
[list]
[*] Fixed issues with Vive controllers not detecting properly if turned off on game launch;
[*] Knives no longer damage equipment so no more exploding grenades in your hands (thx DuskPadlaDusk);
[*] Fixed electrical anomaly not disappearing (thx maciej_pancerny);
[*] Fixed some instances of items falling through the ground.
[/list]

Fixes:
[list]
[*] Added Player Height configuration in Menu and in Tutorial. Should help with Vest moving adequately;
[*] Fixed Monsters, Artifacts,Anomalies and almost everything spawning underground;
[*] Fixed Backpack Rotation and disappearance;
[*] Fixed not working Consumables;
[*] Fixed Player Rotation point;
[*] Oculus Thumbstick deadzones and Thumbstick value has effect on turn speed;
[*] Weapon Attachments attach only while being held in hand;
[*] Reduced water damage.
[/list]

Another update, mostly bug fixing this time.hope now people can complete the last mission.

Fixed Bugs:
- Equipment not saving after mission completion;
- Graphics quality not cycling and stuck at 1.5;
- Rest going to 0 or sleep in general resulting in no wakeup;
- Sleeping bag disappering from inventory - supposedly fixed;
- Ammo not saved on map transition or load game when loaded to shotgun.
 
Features and balance:
- Added yellow stamina bar to relflect character stamina;
- On Death menu displayes a name of last damage source;
- On mission finish menu with more clear mission result message;
- Changed reflector anomaly damage and visibility;
- Improved Menu buton on bracelet: turn heand to make button larger.

Controls Oculus:
- Flip and press changed to just flip up to switch firemode and flip down for mag eject.

Controls Vive:
- Double tap changed to Single tap for sprint.

Known Bugs:
- Distance Grip suddenly disabling - still unknow cause, if you encounter it please report what items you had and when it happened.

